cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AGXForge or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "AGXForge: a native compiler and runtime for the Apple M5 GPU (G17)"
abstract: >-
  AGXForge compiles its own IR to Apple M5 (G17) GPU machine code - instruction
  selection, register allocation, encoder, and the object, metadata and container
  the Metal path loads - on a machine model recovered and checked by measurement.
  The same code runs through Metal and below Metal, the latter with AGXForge's
  runtime writing the launch state and submitting through Apple's private IOGPU
  interface. The release carries the compiler, the runtime, the recovered ISA
  tables, a technical reference, and the measurement receipts behind every claim.
type: software
